<section id="help-find" class="panel guide-section" aria-labelledby="help-find-title" tabindex="-1"><h2 id="help-find-title">Find products and understand stock status</h2>
<ol><li>Open <a href="<?= Ui::escape($config->url('/products')) ?>">Products</a> and search by name or SKU.</li><li>Combine category and stock filters, then open Details for a product. Filters, sorting and page stay in the URL when you edit or return.</li><li>Use <a href="<?= Ui::escape($config->url('/dashboard')) ?>">Dashboard</a> alerts to find items at or below their threshold, including zero.</li></ol>
<p class="guide-note"><strong>Stock status:</strong> Out of stock means zero. Low stock means a positive quantity at or below the threshold. Archived products are excluded from dashboard totals.</p>
<p>Counts on <a href="<?= Ui::escape($config->url('/categories')) ?>">Categories</a><?php if(!$viewer): ?> and <a href="<?= Ui::escape($config->url('/suppliers')) ?>">Suppliers</a><?php endif; ?> link to current product assignments with an explicit active or archived scope.</p></section>
